Thiago,

The problem is that geom_text expects (when parse=TRUE) its label
argument in a particular format; for more details see ?plotmath. You
want to have strings that look like this:

"Trend:~-0.49~mm~year^-1~(p==2.8e-09)"

Notice here that the terms are separated by tildes (~), and a double
equals sign is equality. When the strings are in this format, your
geom_text code above will work.

Ben

