Ale,

Thanks for including data, but your example made me do a little too much work to get to the answer :/

my_map <- qmap("nigeria", zoom = 6, color = "bw", legend = "topleft")

my_map +
> stat_density2d( aes( x = coords.x1,  y = coords.x2, fill = ..level.., alpha = ..level..),  geom = "polygon", mydata) +
> scale_alpha(guide=FALSE) ## this is the part you probably need

That gets rid of the alpha legend.

B

